/  043  WCE  30-0CT-83  CHANGE REG0-REG7 TAGS TO AIR10-AIR17
/  042  LAD  01-0CT-83  "WINNYIZE" VERIFY.
/  041  BCR  28-SEP-83  GOLD HALT return to MENU only
/  040  WCE  19-JUL-83  Modify label for new prefix file
/  039  DFB  21-FEB-83  Fix for ifndef condor
/  038  GJP  09-JAN-83  NOT PICKING UP ALLOCATED BUT UNASSIGNED
