/  037  GJP  17-DEC-82  REMOVE SUPERFLUOUS CODE
/  036  GJP  16-DEC-82  FIX REPORT BAD DISK BUG
/  035  GJP  16-NOV-82  REMOVE RESIDUE LINE FROM SCREEN
/  034  GJP  04-NOV-82  REMOVE ERROR MESSAGE FROM SCREEN (COSMETIC)
/  033  GJP  01-NOV-82  FIX SYSTEM DISKETES NOT VERIFYING
/  032  GJP  26-OCT-82  FIX OVERWRITE ON NO DISKETTE IN DRIVE
/  031  GJP  16-OCT-82  FIX RING BUFFER BUG
/  030  GJP  14-OCT-82  COPY COSCNT NOT IN HOME BLOCK BUG
/  027  GJP  27-MAY-82  ALTER TO HANDLE RX50 DRIVES
/  026  PHA  09-APR-82  INSERT LOOP FOR WHEN DRIVE #1 IS LEFT
