/  025  PHA  22-MAR-82  EXTRA flag for go-to page test
/  024  PHA  1-MAR-82  fix baddsc data field and message
/  023  PHA  28-DEC-81  increase screen hold time on err msgs
/  022  PHA  11-DEC-81  make sure object disk is same density
/          as source before copying
/  021  PHA  10-DEC-81  FIX problem when copying large files
/  020  PHA  5-DEC-81  ADD routine to copy go-to-page blocks
