/D056    /LEAVE IT SO IT CAN BE ENABLED.        /A055
/D056/  JMP I  VEMCHK    /FOR TEST BYPASS      /A055
/D056  CLA
/D056  DCA  FILENO
/D056VEMCH1,  ISZ  FILENO    /GET NEXT FILE
/D056  TAD  FILENO
