  AC2000      /SET 'MULTIPLE CLAIMERS' FLAG    /C056
  JMS  DOCSET    /IN THIS FILE'S DOCLST ENTRY    /A055

/D056  AC7777      /CLEAR ALL THE DATA      /A055
