  JMS  ZDATA    /CLEAR VBLKBF FOR WRITING ALL 0 TO OUTPUT/A055
  DCA  SBLKNO    /START WITH BLOCK 0      /A055
  AC7777      /USE MINUS 1 TO FORCE      /A055
  DCA  AIR13    /THE BLOCK 0 DISPLAY      /A055
INOLP,  TAD  DSKIDX    /GET THE MINUS MAX COUNT    /A055
  TAD  SBLKNO    /ADD THE CURRENT BLOCK NUMBER    /A055
  SMA CLA      /OK WHILE RESULTS ARE MINUS OR EQUAL  /A055
  JMP  CPINIT    /WHEN IT GOES PLUS THE OUTPUT IS ALL 0  /A055
