  TAD  SBLKNO    /GET BACK THE CURRENT BLOCK    /A055
  DCA  BLKOUT    /PASS IT AS THE BLOCK NUMBER    /A055
  TAD  (VBLKBF    /GET THE BUFFER ADDRESS TO PASS ALONG  /A055
  JMS  WRITE0    /CALL THE WRITE SUBROUTINE. RET DF=BUF  /A055
