    RXEWT+4000+2000  /VERIFY THE WRITE      /A055
    2    /HOME BLOCK IS TWO      /A055
    HBLKBF    /FROM THE HOME BLOCK BUFFER    /A055
  JMS  BADDSC    /ON WRITE ERROR, GO TELL    /A055
  TAD  (ABLKBF+4  /LOAD THE START -1      /A055
  DCA  AIR17    /INTO AIR17        /A055
  TAD  ALOCNT    /GET THE 2S COMPLEMENT ALLO WORD COUNT  /A055
