  AC0001      /GET A ONE        /A055
  DCA I  (ABLKBF+3  /SET THE FREE BLOCK COUNT TO ONE  /A055
  JMS I  IQURX    /WRITE OUT FILLED ALLOCATION BLOCK  /A055
    RXEWT+4000+2000  /VERIFY THE WRITE      /A055
    377    /ALLOCATION BLOCK IS 255    /A055
    ABLKBF    /FROM THE ALLOCATION BLOCK BUFFER  /A055
  JMS  BADDSC    /WRITE ERROR?        /A055
