  TAD  (HBLKBF+11)  /SET UP POINTERS
  DCA  HOMPTR    /(HOMPTR)=HBLKBF+11      /M054
  TAD  (-310)
  DCA  HOMCNT    /(HOMCNT)=-310        /M054
