CPYIFN,  /LOOP POINT FOR CPYEND.            /M056
  ISZ  FILENO    /COUNT IT
  ISZ  HOMPTR    /& POINT TO IT

  TAD  BLKOUT    /GET THE CURRENT OUTPUT BLOCK NUMBER  /A056
