WRTEXT,  XX  /WRITE OUT AN EXTENSION BLOCK. PART OF COPYFL    /M056
    /CALLED FROM HDRWRT AND CPYRPB.        /A056
  JMS  NXTOUT    /GET THE NEXT AVAILABLE BLKOUT    /A055
