/D056  CDFBUF      /POINT AT THE BUFFER DATA FIELD    /A054
/D056  DCA I  HOMPTR    /ZERO THE HOME BLOCK ENTRY FOR THIS FILE #/M055
/D056  JMP  CPYEND    /TERMINATE THIS FILE


ZERO,  XX  /FIELD=BUF, (AC)=WORD COUNT, AIR17=ADDRESS-1    /C050
